{"unit_id":"Gorkaseto__dsh-delete-sessions#feature-1","repo":"Gorkaseto/dsh-delete-sessions","commit":"e17f321b7efa549d4fe60867ec895460ec719f7b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Delete Sessions 的功能「永久删除会话」：用户从侧边栏菜单选择删除并在确认框确认后，主机移除会话目录、缓存记录和工作区关联；若会话仍在运行，则加入待处理队列。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:264-309","client.js:311-349","index.js:138-162"]}
